{
  "label": "streets25",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label streets25:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob1.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I manage to find Yumi wandering around the city and somehow coax her into grabbing fate by the balls today.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "After going back and forth for around twenty minutes or so, she finally caves and the two of us make our way to the old district to visit Tsuneyo.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You sure you remember where this place is?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s like the middle of fuckin’ nowhere out here.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I thought you spent a lot of time in this part of town?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Doesn’t mean I know where fuckin’ everything is, jackass.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This place is confusing as shit to navigate sometimes.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s easy to get lost. And it sucks when you do because of all the fuckin’ homeless people out here tryin’ to nab your spare change and shit.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": At least they haven’t bothered us yet.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Give it a minute or two, they’ll find you. Always fuckin’ do.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We make our way down the street toward Tojo Ramen.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Thankfully, I do remember the way on account of coming here to see Tsuneyo, but it seems like Yumi is genuine when she says she doesn’t know where it is.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She’s right in saying this part of town is easy to get lost in.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It feels almost like a labyrinth at times.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Abandoned building after abandoned building cloud the landscape while dwellings of impoverished living stack haphazardly on top of one another.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Every once in a while, a stray cat will run past us. Some of them even stop and rub up against Yumi.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She has no reaction.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She must truly be heartless.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob2.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thanks for coming...I guess.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not because I’m nervous or anything. I just wouldn’t have been able to find the place on my own.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, it’s not like you have an interview scheduled or anything.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You could pretty much come here whenever you want. No one’s expecting you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you gonna fucking say “You’re welcome” or are you just gonna try and make me sound like an idiot?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Feel like every time I try and say somethin’ nice, you just throw it back in my face.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To be fair, you’ve only said two or three nice things to me since we’ve met.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah but those might be the only two or three nice things you ever get out of me, so it’s probably best if you don’t fuckin’ toss ‘em aside so easily.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re welcome, Yumi. I’m happy to have been of some sort of help to you today.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Even if it is only as a GPS.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob1.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": See? Was that so fucking hard?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The walk continues.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We weave our way through the streets in the second half of town and manage to dodge enough panhandlers to finally come close to our destination.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob3.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, I’m obviously not going to use your stupid strategy from the other night...but just for peace of mind, what was it again?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just telling Tsuneyo how much you love noodles over and over.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I honestly can’t imagine that not working.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob4.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s so fucking weird...I don’t get it at all.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Neither do I. But hey, at least she knows her interests.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And besides, it’s a weird little shop in the middle of nowhere. If it had a normal interview process, it would lose its charm.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob5.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There’s no charm in a place like this.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just a bunch of fuck-ups and burnouts tryin’ to make it one more day without givin’ up on life.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thing about places like this is that if you spend too much time in ‘em, they wind up drainin’ you.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You lose any sense of hope...give up on your dreams and think shit like, “Somethin’ that good won’t ever happen to me.”",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It eats away at you.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And before you know it, you’re wakin’ up in an alley with a needle stickin’ out of your arm thinking, “How the fuck did it come to this?”",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m hoping you’ve never woken up like that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob6.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Me? Nahh.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Drugs are cheap, so I probably could, though.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hell, probably still might if things never wind up gettin’ any better.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I’ve seen how that shit works firsthand and it’s not pretty. So I’ve somehow managed to avoid it one way or another.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothing’s ever certain, though. Desperation can make people do crazy shit.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So who knows? Maybe one day, the reason I won’t be in[school] might be a lot worse than just me not wantin’ to show up.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "For what might be the first time ever, I actually understand where Yumi’s coming from.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m obviously a lot less experienced in the topic than she seems to be, but she’s smart enough to realize how dangerous a life like that is.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And yet she chooses to walk that path, surviving solely off of thievery and handouts from her best friend.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But it’s not like that makes her weak.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Those are just the circumstances she’s found herself in.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Good for her.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m proud of you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just want you to know that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob2.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Suck my dick, you fucking [rapist].",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t try to act like my dad just because I opened up for a second.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s just...a long walk and I’m fuckin’ bored.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are we there yet?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just a few more blocks.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And so we walk a few more blocks.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The scent of pork broth hits us from a quarter mile away, which is actually quite surprising given that Tojo Ramen doesn’t have any windows for the scent to leak out of.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I wonder why that is?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait. Stop...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob7.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Yumi comes to a sudden halt just as we’re about to round the final corner to Tojo Ramen.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "In front of us is the same woman who I wound up buying dinner for the first time I ever went there.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And I’m assuming she’s the reason Yumi is suddenly hesitating.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...Yeah, I don’t know if I’m feeling up to this today, dude.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My stomach hurts and I think I’m just gonna head back to Chika’s place and crash.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But it’s right around the corner. We’ve been walking for hours.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": At least give it a shot.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Pass. I’ll give it a shot another day. I-",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If it’s because you’re worried about that girl over there, I know from experience that she’s not as bad as she looks.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob8.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s my fucking mom, you idiot!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And what kind of experience do you have with her?!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That is your mom?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...I bought her dinner once.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob9.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why did you buy dinner for my mom?!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn’t know she was your mom.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We have the same fucking eyes!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Besides, she is as bad as she looks! And I have a lot more experience with her than you do, I can tell you that.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who the fuck did you think I was talking about when I went on that rant about drugs and shit like ten minutes ago?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’s a fucking psycho. And who the fuck knows what will happen if she sees me here?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob10.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Yumi’s apparent mother suddenly shifts her eyes in our direction and causes Yumi to flinch in response.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She grabs my wrist and forcefully pulls me into an alleyway right beside us, throwing her body up against mine and bringing her voice to a whisper.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob11.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you even think about touching me right now, I will fucking kill you.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You are aware that you’re the one pinning me to the wall, right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Only because I have no idea what I’d fucking say to her and she was about to look this way.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You smell nice.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob12.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Shut the fuck up! I do not!",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How long do I need to shut up for?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": As much as I’d like to spend the entire day in an alleyway with you, I feel like we’re going to need to come out sooner or later.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob13.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We need to...I don’t know...figure out a way to distract her or some shit.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene yumiramenjob14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/yumiramenjob14.webp",
      "alt": "yumiramenjob14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You said the ramen place is right around the corner, right?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right. You make the next right and it’s literally the only building there. It’s a dead end right after that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then why don’t you...go and fucking talk to her for a minute or something?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
